WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.029 --> 00:00:06.452
"Hurry!" Wanda said. "Find something to grab."

2
00:00:06.453 --> 00:00:10.409
"But," Cora said. "I need to—"

3
00:00:10.410 --> 00:00:14.125
"I'll tell everyone about the earthquake," Wanda said.

4
00:00:14.126 --> 00:00:18.016
"Big waves don't usually harm whales."

5
00:00:18.017 --> 00:00:22.121
Wanda swam off.

6
00:00:22.122 --> 00:00:27.082
"Let's go, Mo," Cora said.

7
00:00:27.083 --> 00:00:30.436
They swam past the parrot fish.

8
00:00:30.437 --> 00:00:34.622
"There's an earthquake coming!" Cora yelled.

9
00:00:34.623 --> 00:00:39.888
"We'll hide under the coral," the parrot fish said.

10
00:00:39.889 --> 00:00:45.082
Just then the ground shook hard.

11
00:00:45.083 --> 00:00:50.897
"Ahh!" Mo yelled as giant waves tossed them.

12
00:00:50.898 --> 00:00:54.055
Cora grabbed onto a large rock.

13
00:00:54.056 --> 00:00:58.209
She held Mo tightly.

14
00:00:58.210 --> 00:01:02.264
Soon the shaking stopped.

15
00:01:02.265 --> 00:01:04.991
Cora looked around.

16
00:01:04.992 --> 00:01:08.037
The water was filled with sand.

17
00:01:08.038 --> 00:01:13.742
"Phew!" Cora said. "Everything looks okay."

18
00:01:13.743 --> 00:01:17.155
"Help!" voices cried.

19
00:01:17.156 --> 00:01:20.669
Cora and Mo zoomed toward the sound.

20
00:01:20.670 --> 00:01:24.019
Wanda was near a big piece of coral.

21
00:01:24.020 --> 00:01:28.420
"It's the parrot fish!

22
00:01:28.421 --> 00:01:31.545
They're trapped under this coral."

23
00:01:31.546 --> 00:01:37.157
No one could move the big coral.

24
00:01:37.158 --> 00:01:44.694
"The compass can help," Cora said.

25
00:01:44.695 --> 00:01:50.178
She shot her ink, and the shell opened.

26
00:01:50.179 --> 00:01:53.717
It showed some groupers.

27
00:01:53.718 --> 00:01:57.500
Cora groaned.

28
00:01:57.501 --> 00:02:00.830
"What's wrong?" Mo asked.

29
00:02:00.831 --> 00:02:05.178
"Groupers live near the surface," she said.

30
00:02:05.179 --> 00:02:10.596
"It'll take a while to swim up there!"

